name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-preassessment-q7_2025'

question 'A weather website uses the same code to display today\'s temperature in many different cities. What\'s the main reason the developer would put that code inside a function?'

wrong 'To make the website load random temperatures every time'
wrong 'To hide the data so no one can see how the site works'
right 'To reuse the same logic easily without rewriting it for each city'
wrong 'To prevent users from changing the city they want to check'

allow_multiple_attempts false

